uicidal behavior: a neglected field</article-title><source>Curr Opin Psychiatry</source><volume>19</volume><fpage>288</fpage><lpage>93</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16612215</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b31-ndt-3-735"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Sleep and adolescent suicidal behavior</article-title><source>Sleep</source><volume>27</volume><fpage>1351</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15586788</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b32-ndt-3-735"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mann</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Brent</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Arango</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>The neurobiology and genetics of suicide and attempted suicide: a focus on the serotonergic system</article-title><source>Neuropsychopharmacology</source><volume>24</volume><fpage>467</fpage><lpage>77</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11282247</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b33-ndt-3-735"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mann</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>A current perspective of suicide and attempted suicide</article-title><source>Ann Intern Med</source><volume>136</volume><fpage>302</fpage><lpage>11</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11848728</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b34-ndt-3-735"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maris</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Suicide</article-title><source>Lancet</source><volume>360</volume><fpage>319</fpage><lpage>26</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12147388</pub-id>